@base = https://localhost:7039


### 1. Product banayein
POST {{base}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "mug-001",
  "name": "Coffee Mug",
  "description": "350ml",
  "price": 2500
}

### 2. Wahi SKU dobara (409 Conflict aana chahiye)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "mug-001",
  "name": "Coffee Mug",
  "description": "350ml",
  "price": 2500
}

### 3. Product fetch karein
GET {{base}}/api/v1/products/sku/MUG-001

### 4. Galat price (400 Bad Request)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "bad-001",
  "name": "Bad",
  "description": "",
  "price": 0
}

### 5. Missing product (404 Not Found)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/products/sku/NOPE-999
